            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "Break The Food Chain is an arcade game about cute little animals shooting at each other in the face like there is no tomorrow.<br />\r\nFight your way out of the food chain with with blades, bullets, bananas and lasers. A colourful cast of animals and machines will try to stop you with ever-increasing numbers and heavier weaponry at their disposal.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n+ Over 20 challenging levels with various, traps, bosses and enemy types and increasing difficulty.<br />\r\n+ A large arsenal of weapons ranging from cleavers and laser rifles to rocket launchers and auto shotguns.<br />\r\n+ 8 Playable characters with their own unique playstyles and abilities.<br />\r\n+ An upgrade system that will give you the upper hand in the way that you see fit.<br />\r\n+ Adorable Pixel Art and a chiptune soundtrack.",
